Package: BSSUnfoldR
Type: Package
Title: Neutron Spectrum Unfolding for Bonner Sphere Spectrometers
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-09-16
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "BSSUnfoldR port",
           family = "Maintainer",
           email = "bssunfoldr@example.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Author: BSSUnfoldR port contributors
Maintainer: BSSUnfoldR port <bssunfoldr@example.org>
Description: A port of the Python package 'bssunfold' (Radiationsafety/bssunfold)
    to R. Provides tools for unfolding neutron spectra measured with Bonner
    sphere spectrometers, including a Detector R6 class, ten classic
    unfolding algorithms (MLEM, GRAVEL, MAXED, SAND-II, BUNKI, FERDOR,
    STAY'SL, Landweber, CGLS and TSVD), Monte-Carlo uncertainty estimation,
    and dose-rate calculation using ICRP-74, ICRP-116 and NRB99-2009
    conversion coefficients plus seven published Bonner-sphere response
    functions (GSF, PTB, LANL, JINR, FERMILAB, EURADOS, IHEP).
